of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Key Life Events", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Life events are important things that happen during your life. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use expressions like<span class=\"italic\"> life-changing</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Did you know that ... ?</span> to talk about key life events.<br />   You use an expression like <span class=\"italic\">someday</span> to talk about a life event in the future. You cannot be sure about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Event </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Expressions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"first day of school/work<br /> birthday<br /> graduation<br /> getting a job<br /> starting a business<br /> promotion<br /> wedding <br /> having kids<br /> anniversary (10th/25th)<br /> retiring \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"memorable<br />  eventful<br /> life-changing<br /> Did you know that ... ?<br /> I/It was so ... <br /> When was the last time ... ?<br /> someday\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Future Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you use the Future tense in the affirmative form, you can use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.<br />   <span class=\"italic\">Structure</span>: will + base form of the verb<br /> <span class=\"italic\">Short Form</span>:  'll + base form of the verb", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use this form to:<ul>  \t<li>make a prediction:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">It will be an exciting year for you.</span> </li> \t<li>make an offer to do something for someone else in the future:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">I will buy you a ticket for your birthday.</span></li> \t<li> talk about a decision made now:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">I will send you photos of my trip.</span></li> </ul>   \t\t\t", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "graduation ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the completion of a university degree or high school ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My graduation is coming up soon.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about life events.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to move out ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go live in a different place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to move out when I'm done school.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "on my own ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "alone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to live on my own.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "performance evaluation ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a discussion about how well you are doing your job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have a performance evaluation next week.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "trial period ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a short work period where you work to see whether you are the right person for a job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My trial period lasted two weeks.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "head chef", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the main cook in a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you going to be the head chef?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "catering business", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the business of providing and serving food and drinks at parties ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to start my own catering business. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to marry ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become a wife or husband", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When are you getting married?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to have kids ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become a parent to a child", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to have two kids.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le03ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write down 5 key life events that happened to you. When did they happen?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 3 key life events that will happen in the future. When do you think they will happen?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Draw a line on a piece of paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Draw little lines along the line. Write down a key life event beside each line. Write down the year it happened or you think it will happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your timeline with your class.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about key life events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about events in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my timeline with my class.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le03ob01re2img07.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob01re2img07.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey Sally! How's Moscow?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's fantastic! I will send you some cool pictures.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll visit Russia someday.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll buy you a ticket for your birthday next year!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You don't have to do that.<br>"}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "11750", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It'll be an exciting year for you. Your graduation is coming up!<br>\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm nervous! After graduation, I will need to look for an apartment. Then, I'm moving out on my own. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: To your own place?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah and I have a performance evaluation coming up.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Your two week trial period is done?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, it'll be two weeks this Tuesday."}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob01re2img06.jpg", "time": "33000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: That was quick. Are you going to get a promotion? Become the head chef?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  No way! I'm not ready for that! I need more experience!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you want to start your own catering business?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not anytime soon. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: You can start one after you get married and have 2 kids!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Sally! I have to go. I'll message you later."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le03ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le03ob01re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn5le03ob01re6aud04", "coverimg": "engenn5le03ob01re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "id": 3}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about key life events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things, actions and events in the future. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What is an important event in your life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Why do you remember this event? How important is this event in your life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"},